From: Wren <wren@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] JSC: port the 32-bit DFG to the 2.54 DataIC property-cache design

2.54 made every DFG property cache an unlinked cache (DFG::JITCompiler::addPropertyInlineCache() returns a
DFG::UnlinkedPropertyInlineCache; JITData::tryInitialize() builds HandlerPropertyInlineCache objects in the JITData and
the generated code reaches them through GPRInfo::jitDataRegister), but only DFGSpeculativeJIT64.cpp was converted. The
32-bit backend still used the old repatching form (JITGetByIdGenerator::generateFastPath() on a null
gen.propertyCache(), TrustedImmPtr(gen.propertyCache()) == 0 in the slow-path call), so every 32-bit DFG compile that
contained a property access crashed at the first IC.

- DFGJITCompiler: load jitDataRegister at every DFG entry (compileSetupRegistersForEntry) and in the OSR-entry thunk,
  and implement loadPropertyInlineCache() for 32-bit (cache == jitDataRegister - (index + 1) * sizeof(cache)).
- DFGSpeculativeJIT32_64: convert GetById, GetByIdWithThis, GetByVal, PutById (+private name), PutByVal (+private name),
  DeleteById/ByVal, InById/InByVal, HasPrivateName/Brand, GetPrivateName, Check/SetPrivateBrand and InstanceOf from
  the repatching form to the 64-bit backend's DataIC form: operands are flushed (flushRegisters()), shuffled into the
  fixed BaselineJITRegisters (new SpeculativeJIT::shuffleOperandsForDataIC(); a payload-only operand is a known cell and
  gets JSValue::CellTag in its tag register), the handler is dispatched through the cache, and the slow path is a
  slowPathICCall through HandlerPropertyInlineCache::offsetOfSlowOperation().
  The GetByIdFlush/PutByIdFlush variants collapse into the plain nodes, as in the 64-bit backend.
diff --git a/Source/JavaScriptCore/dfg/DFGJITCompiler.cpp b/Source/JavaScriptCore/dfg/DFGJITCompiler.cpp
--- a/Source/JavaScriptCore/dfg/DFGJITCompiler.cpp
+++ b/Source/JavaScriptCore/dfg/DFGJITCompiler.cpp
@@ -164,10 +164,8 @@
     jitAssertCodeBlockOnCallFrameWithType(GPRInfo::numberTagRegister, JITType::DFGJIT);
 #endif
